- Survival/hazard gap tests and Gaussian-process drift
- Joint conformal prediction sets
- Cross-fitted Super Learner and distributionally robust stacking
- Compression/MDL and permutation mutual information
- Synthetic-null laboratory
- Model Confidence Set
- Immutable SHA-256 prospective registry
- Player-choice/prize-sharing heuristic
- Prize-tier probability and expected-value framework
- Exact CP/MILP covering-design optimisation

## Current evidence

- Main mixture e-value: 0.042673
- Euro mixture e-value: 0.052534
- HMM preferred states: 1
- Synthetic-null empirical p: 0.710744
