No reliable non-uniform draw-probability edge was established. The advanced methods are integrated for prospective research and cannot alter deployed probabilities until every gate passes.

## Run

```bash
python run_eurojackpot_advanced_selftest_v3_3.py
```

## Responsible use

Coverage, anti-crowd and expected-value tools do not make an individual line more likely to be drawn.
Prize inputs default to zero unless verified payout data is supplied.
